; Matches HUD.tscn's StatPanel style (warm cream / brown border) for visual
; consistency, but pushed to near-opaque (0.98 vs the HUD's 0.9) -- this
; panel sits directly over gameplay content behind it and needs to stay
; readable, unlike the HUD overlay which is meant to feel lighter-weight.
